  1218→   strings in the series has an L prefix, the result is a wide string
  1219→   (6.4.5p4).  Whether or not the result is a wide string affects the
  1220→   meaning of octal and hexadecimal escapes (6.4.4.4p6,9).  But escape
  1221→   sequences do not continue across the boundary between two strings in
  1222→   a series (6.4.5p7), so we must not lose the boundaries.  Therefore
  1223→   cpp_interpret_string takes a vector of cpp_string structures, which
  1224→   we must arrange to provide.  */
