  1244→     concatenation.  It is 'true' if we have seen an '@' before the
  1245→     current string, and 'false' if not.  We must see exactly one or
  1246→     zero '@' before each string.  */
  1247→  bool objc_at_sign_was_seen = false;
  1248→
  1249→ retry:
  1250→  tok = cpp_get_token (parse_in);
