Looking at the code more carefully, I see that at line 29-35 of create-route-map.js, there's a loop that moves wildcards to the end:

```javascript
  // ensure wildcard routes are always at the end
  for (let i = 0, l = pathList.length; i < l; i++) {
    if (pathList[i] === '*') {
      pathList.push(pathList.splice(i, 1)[0])
      l--
      i--
    }
  }
```

